Xreader — mihon-api module
===========================

This module is the host-side API surface for Keiyoushi manga extensions
(extension-lib / "tachiyomix" 1.6). It is a transplant: per the project's
MAX-COPY rule (user steering, 2026-11-01), donor code is copied rather than
re-implemented wherever a choice existed, and every remaining substitution is
named below.

